{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Absorb Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Adaptarian you have the ability to absorb elemental magic from magical shrines, use these different elemental abilities to manipulate the world in different ways. The strong <strong>Stone</strong> element can push, pull, punch and break heavy boulders and walls. The sticky <strong>Slime</strong> element to get climb to higher places, slip through grates or leave behind globs of slime to hold down buttons. Use the slippery <strong>Ice</strong> element to freeze and melt water sources and waterfalls. Use the tricky <strong>Air</strong> element to become light as a feather and use its special dash to get to previously unreachable places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/57ac6f593c3fad5b1b7379a21f17085d.poster.avif?t=1764086238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/57ac6f593c3fad5b1b7379a21f17085d.webm?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/57ac6f593c3fad5b1b7379a21f17085d.mp4?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted roots have settled into the world due to a lack of guidance. As you progress through and complete puzzles the roots will start retreating where they came from and leave the plants and creatures alone. Interact with the world to return life to the area. watch how grass and flowers grow back, frogs settle in the area and color returns to dying plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/f7d40785adfaba72405485975f77532f.poster.avif?t=1764086238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/f7d40785adfaba72405485975f77532f.webm?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/f7d40785adfaba72405485975f77532f.mp4?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find hidden collectables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret items that give a more in depth look at the world before the Adaptarians mysteriously disappeared. From common household items to more magical artifacts, Try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take a breather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a well deserved rest on some benches and chairs scattered through the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/041f07c5099a28ad76d51dd39a574537.poster.avif?t=1764086238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/041f07c5099a28ad76d51dd39a574537.webm?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104680/extras/041f07c5099a28ad76d51dd39a574537.mp4?t=1764086238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104680?t=1764086238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104680?t=1764086238","capsule_image":"